        "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(R\u2227P)\u2228Q?$",
        "worked_solution": "We distribute the disjunction over the conjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\n(R\u2227P)\u2228Q\u2261(R\u2228Q)\u2227(P\u2228Q)\n$$\n\nNow, since $R\u2228Q\u2261Q\u2228R,$ we can write\n\n$$\n(R\u2228Q)\u2227(P\u2228Q)\u2261(Q\u2228R)\u2227(P\u2228Q).\n$$",
